# Personal content. Private to each individual — never committed.
# Templates are the exception: they hold placeholders, not real content.
*resume*.md
*Resume*.md
!*.template.md

# Build output and any rendered resume, whatever it's named.
# ./build.sh regenerates these; Resume_Template.docx is a tracked design source.
*.docx
!Resume_Template.docx
_refbuild/
